    kind: invariant  # a0a0
    title: "coverage_census lazy-greedy (CELF) diverges from cost-weighted greedy when tests share a group fixed cost: a charged group makes its other tests cheaper, so stale ratios are lower bounds, not upper bounds"  # a0a0
    status: violated  # a0a0
    priority: 3  # a0a0
    parent:  # a0a0
